-- dot clouds
a visible dot charges at least 1136 bytes: working bytes bind by 472597 dots, not at 1048576 draws
1048576 visible dots need at least 1136 MiB in the job and 248 MiB of commands a frame in flight
-- stroke search: where one vector leaves its bins, with a default budget
memberships are about 2 N^2 x (control box area / frame area), N curves in the one vector
boxes covering 1 of the frame: scans above about 2896 curves
boxes covering 0.1 of the frame: scans above about 9159 curves
boxes covering 0.01 of the frame: scans above about 28963 curves
boxes covering 0.0001 of the frame: scans above about 289631 curves
16777216 memberships is 64 MiB of entries
-- operations a frame, not seconds
32400 fine tiles; every tile tests every draw's bounds
731 rows: 2.368e+07 bounds tests
472597 dots: 1.531e+10 bounds tests
1048576 dots: 3.397e+10 bounds tests
